  <div class="container">
    <p class="section__eyebrow">About</p>
    <div class="about__body">
      <p>
        I'm a venture builder and product operator based in London, with
        10 years of experience bringing new products and businesses to
        life.
      </p>
      <p>
        I've done this in every shape and size — from co-founding
        <strong>Shandy Shack</strong>, an award-winning craft drinks
        brand I grew from a festival pop-up to a seven-figure
        acquisition, to leading product and operations at
        <strong>Zeti</strong>, a London fintech building the
        infrastructure for the next generation of asset finance. Before
        that, I spent three years at <strong>Accenture Song</strong>
        advising international businesses on digital strategy and
        innovation.
      </p>
      <p>
        What ties it all together is a genuine love of building things
        from scratch — and the discipline to see them through.
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside work, I travel as much as I can (particularly around the
        less-visited corners of Western Europe), stay active with
        friends, and watch a lot of Spanish cinema.
      </p>
